<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>逐日潮位統計月報表　{{ station.name_zh }}　{{ year }}</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+TC:wght@600;700&family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@400;500;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --ink:      #1D3557;
    --steel:    #457B9D;
    --stripe:   #F1F3F5;
    --text:     #212529;
    --hairline: #C9D2D8;
    --paper:    #FFFFFF;
    --neg:      #1A5276;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: #DDE3E7;
    font-family: 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 7.5px;
  }
  @media print {
    body { background: #fff; }
    .page { margin: 0; box-shadow: none; }
  }

  /* ── A4 直式 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  @page { size: A4 portrait; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 210mm;
    min-height: 297mm;
    margin: 10px auto;
    background: var(--paper);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
    padding: 7mm 7mm 6mm 7mm;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .page-break { page-break-after: always; }

  /* ── 頁首 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .report-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 3mm;
    margin-bottom: 2mm;
  }
  .header-title { flex: 0 0 auto; text-align: center; }
  .title-zh {
    font-family: 'Noto Serif TC', serif;
    font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink); letter-spacing: 1px; white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .title-en {
    font-size: 7px; font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--steel); letter-spacing: 3px; margin-top: 1px;
  }
  .header-info {
    flex: 1; font-size: 7px; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .header-info .lbl { color: var(--steel); }
  .header-info .datum { font-size: 6.5px; color: #6c757d; margin-top: 1px; }
  .header-right {
    flex: 0 0 auto; text-align: right;
    font-size: 8.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .header-right .sponsor { font-size: 6px; font-weight: 400; color: #6c757d; }

  /* ── 主體：資料表 + 統計欄 ────────────────────────────────────── */
  .content-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 3mm;
    flex: 1;
    align-items: flex-start;
    min-height: 0;
  }

  /* ── 資料表 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
     欄寬（合計 ≈ 148mm）：
     月相 5 | 日 9 | 農曆 11 | 時間×4 各 14 | 潮高×4 各 12 | 潮差 13     */
  table.main-table {
    width: 148mm;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    table-layout: fixed;
  }
  col.c-moon   { width:  5mm; }
  col.c-greg   { width:  9mm; }
  col.c-lunar  { width: 11mm; }
  col.c-time   { width: 14mm; }
  col.c-height { width: 12mm; }
  col.c-range  { width: 13mm; }

  thead th {
    background: var(--ink); color: #fff;
    font-weight: 500; font-size: 6.5px;
    padding: 1.5px 1px; text-align: center;
    border: 0.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2); line-height: 1.3;
  }
  thead th.th-date { font-size: 7px; font-weight: 700; }
  thead th.th-group { font-size: 6.5px; }
  thead th.th-sub   { font-size: 6px; }

  tbody td {
    padding: 1.3mm 0;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--hairline);
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 7px; text-align: center;
    vertical-align: middle; line-height: 1;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  tbody tr:nth-child(even) td { background: var(--stripe); }
  td.moon-sym {
    font-family: 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif;
    font-size: 7.5px; color: var(--ink); padding: 0;
  }
  td.greg-day  { font-size: 7.5px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink); }
  td.lunar-date {
    font-family: 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif;
    font-size: 6px; color: #555; line-height: 1.35;
  }
  td.tide-time { font-size: 6.5px; }
  td.tide-h    { }
  td.neg-val   { color: var(--neg); }
  td.range-val { font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink); border-left: 1px solid var(--hairline); }

  /* ── 統計欄 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
     寬度 45mm，位於右側                                             */
  .stats-panel {
    width: 45mm;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    border-radius: 2px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    font-size: 7px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .stats-title {
    background: var(--ink); color: #fff;
    font-family: 'Noto Serif TC', serif;
    font-size: 7.5px; font-weight: 700;
    text-align: center; padding: 2mm 0 1.5mm;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px; line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .stats-item {
    padding: 2.2mm 3mm 2mm;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--hairline);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .stats-item:nth-child(even) { background: var(--stripe); }
  .stats-item.no-border { border-bottom: none; }
  .stats-lbl {
    color: var(--steel); font-size: 6.5px; font-weight: 500;
    display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5mm;
  }
  .stats-val {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 8px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink);
    display: block;
  }
  .stats-val.neg-val { color: var(--neg); }
  .stats-dt {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 6.5px; color: #555;
    display: block; margin-top: 0.5mm;
  }
  .stats-notes {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 2mm 3mm;
    border-bottom: none;
  }
  .stats-notes .stats-lbl { margin-bottom: 1mm; }

  /* ── 腳注 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .footnote {
    margin-top: 1.5mm;
    font-size: 6.5px; color: #6c757d; line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* ── 頁尾 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  footer.page-footer {
    margin-top: 1mm; padding-top: 1.5mm;
    border-top: 0.5px solid var(--hairline);
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 6px; color: #6c757d;
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

{% for page in pages %}
<div class="page{% if not loop.last %} page-break{% endif %}">

  <!-- 頁首 -->
  <div class="report-header">
    <div class="header-title">
      <div class="title-zh">交通部中央氣象署逐日潮位統計月報表</div>
      <div class="title-en">Monthly &nbsp; Summary &nbsp; of &nbsp; Tidal &nbsp; Statistics</div>
    </div>
    <div class="header-info">
      <div>
        <span class="lbl">測 站(Station): </span>{{ station.name_zh }}潮位站 {{ station.name_en }}
        &ensp;
        <span class="lbl">位 置(Location): </span>{{ station.lat }}　{{ station.lon }}　{{ station.location }}
      </div>
      <div class="datum">
        潮高基準(Datum): 相對臺灣高程基準(TaiWan Vertical Datum 2001, TWVD2001)基隆海平面。
        &ensp;潮高單位(Unit): 公分(cm)
        {% if station.benchmark_id %}
        &ensp;潮高參考水準點: 編號{{ station.benchmark_id }}
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="header-right">
      民國{{ page.roc_year }}年{{ page.month_zh }}<br>
      {{ page.month_en }} {{ page.year }}
      {% if station.sponsor %}
      <br><span class="sponsor">資料來源(sponsor): {{ station.sponsor }}</span>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 主體 -->
  <div class="content-row">

    <!-- 左側：逐日高低潮資料表 -->
    <table class="main-table">
      <colgroup>
        <col class="c-moon">
        <col class="c-greg">
        <col class="c-lunar">
        <col class="c-time">  <col class="c-height">  {# 1st H #}
        <col class="c-time">  <col class="c-height">  {# 1st L #}
        <col class="c-time">  <col class="c-height">  {# 2nd H #}
        <col class="c-time">  <col class="c-height">  {# 2nd L #}
        <col class="c-range">
      </colgroup>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th rowspan="2" colspan="2" class="th-date">日 期<br>Day</th>
          <th rowspan="2" style="font-size:5.5px;line-height:1.4;">農<br>曆</th>
          <th colspan="2" class="th-group">第一次高潮<br>1st High Tide</th>
          <th colspan="2" class="th-group">第一次低潮<br>1st Low Tide</th>
          <th colspan="2" class="th-group">第二次高潮<br>2nd High Tide</th>
          <th colspan="2" class="th-group">第二次低潮<br>2nd Low Tide</th>
          <th rowspan="2" class="th-group">潮差<br>Diurnal<br>Range</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th class="th-sub">時間<br>Time</th>
          <th class="th-sub">潮高<br>Height</th>
          <th class="th-sub">時間<br>Time</th>
          <th class="th-sub">潮高<br>Height</th>
          <th class="th-sub">時間<br>Time</th>
          <th class="th-sub">潮高<br>Height</th>
          <th class="th-sub">時間<br>Time</th>
          <th class="th-sub">潮高<br>Height</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for row in page.rows %}
        <tr>
          <td class="moon-sym">{{ row.moon_sym }}</td>
          <td class="greg-day">{{ row.greg_day }}</td>
          <td class="lunar-date">
            {% if row.lunar_month is not none %}
              {{ row.lunar_month }}<br>{{ row.lunar_day }}
            {% endif %}
          </td>

          {% if row.is_blank %}
            {# Rule b：整日空白 #}
            {% for _ in range(9) %}<td></td>{% endfor %}
          {% else %}
            {# 1st High #}
            <td class="tide-time">{{ row.h1_time or '' }}</td>
            <td class="tide-h{% if row.h1_height is not none and row.h1_height < 0 %} neg-val{% endif %}">
              {{ row.h1_height if row.h1_height is not none else '' }}
            </td>
            {# 1st Low #}
            <td class="tide-time">{{ row.l1_time or '' }}</td>
            <td class="tide-h{% if row.l1_height is not none and row.l1_height < 0 %} neg-val{% endif %}">
              {{ row.l1_height if row.l1_height is not none else '' }}
            </td>
            {# 2nd High #}
            <td class="tide-time">{{ row.h2_time or '' }}</td>
            <td class="tide-h{% if row.h2_height is not none and row.h2_height < 0 %} neg-val{% endif %}">
              {{ row.h2_height if row.h2_height is not none else '' }}
            </td>
            {# 2nd Low #}
            <td class="tide-time">{{ row.l2_time or '' }}</td>
            <td class="tide-h{% if row.l2_height is not none and row.l2_height < 0 %} neg-val{% endif %}">
              {{ row.l2_height if row.l2_height is not none else '' }}
            </td>
            {# Diurnal Range #}
            <td class="range-val{% if row.diurnal_range is not none and row.diurnal_range < 0 %} neg-val{% endif %}">
              {{ row.diurnal_range if row.diurnal_range is not none else '' }}
            </td>
          {% endif %}
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <!-- 右側：統計值面板 -->
    <div class="stats-panel">
      <div class="stats-title">統 計 值<br>Statistics</div>

      {% set s = page.stats %}

      <div class="stats-item">
        <span class="stats-lbl">平均海面位 (MSL)</span>
        <span class="stats-val{% if s and s.msl is not none and s.msl < 0 %} neg-val{% endif %}">
          {% if s and s.msl is not none %}{{ s.msl }}{{ s.star }} cm{% else %}—{% endif %}
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="stats-item">
        <span class="stats-lbl">平均高潮位 (MHWL)</span>
        <span class="stats-val">
          {% if s and s.mhwl is not none %}{{ s.mhwl }}{{ s.star }} cm{% else %}—{% endif %}
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="stats-item">
        <span class="stats-lbl">平均低潮位 (MLWL)</span>
        <span class="stats-val{% if s and s.mlwl is not none and s.mlwl < 0 %} neg-val{% endif %}">
          {% if s and s.mlwl is not none %}{{ s.mlwl }}{{ s.star }} cm{% else %}—{% endif %}
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="stats-item">
        <span class="stats-lbl">平均潮差 (MR)</span>
        <span class="stats-val">
          {% if s and s.mr is not none %}{{ s.mr }}{{ s.star }} cm{% else %}—{% endif %}
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="stats-item">
        <span class="stats-lbl">最大潮差 (MTR)</span>
        <span class="stats-val">
          {% if s and s.mtr is not none %}{{ s.mtr }}{{ s.star }} cm{% else %}—{% endif %}
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="stats-item">
        <span class="stats-lbl">最低低潮位 (LLWL)</span>
        {% if s and s.llwl is not none %}
        <span class="stats-dt">{{ s.llwl_day }}日 {{ s.llwl_time }}</span>
        <span class="stats-val neg-val">{{ s.llwl }}{{ s.star }} cm</span>
        {% else %}
        <span class="stats-val">—</span>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="stats-item">
        <span class="stats-lbl">最高高潮位 (HHWL)</span>
        {% if s and s.hhwl is not none %}
        <span class="stats-dt">{{ s.hhwl_day }}日 {{ s.hhwl_time }}</span>
        <span class="stats-val">{{ s.hhwl }}{{ s.star }} cm</span>
        {% else %}
        <span class="stats-val">—</span>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="stats-item">
        <span class="stats-lbl">最高天文潮 (HAT)</span>
        <span class="stats-val">
          {% if s and s.hat is not none %}{{ s.hat }}{{ s.star }} cm{% else %}—{% endif %}
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="stats-notes stats-item no-border">
        <span class="stats-lbl">備　註</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div><!-- .content-row -->

  <!-- 腳注 -->
  <div class="footnote">
    註：1.空白表示沒有觀測或儀器故障。<br>
    &emsp;&ensp;2.＊表示該月觀測次數少於應測次數 2/3，右側統計值可能不具代表性。<br>
    &emsp;&ensp;3.●新月New moon　◐上弦First Quarter Moon　○滿月Full moon　◑下弦Third Quarter Moon
  </div>

  <footer class="page-footer">
    <div></div>
    <div>{{ station.name_zh }}潮位站　Tidal Observation Data Annual Report {{ page.year }}</div>
  </footer>

</div>
{% endfor %}

</body>
</html>
